    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Classify this real estate lead into exactly one category:\n\nHot Lead, Warm Lead, Just Browsing, or Unrelated.\n\n\nRules:\n\n- Hot Lead: Pre-approved, looking to move ASAP/immediately, or ready to buy/lease very soon.\n\n- Warm Lead: Has specific criteria (e.g., specific budget, bedroom count, views, or location) and a future timeline (e.g., next year, months away), but lacks immediate urgency.\n\n- Just Browsing: Casual, window-shopping, early-stage real estate interest with no specific criteria or set timeline mentioned.\n\n- Unrelated: Casual chat, wrong numbers, automated spam, or website support issues that are completely unrelated to buying, renting, or viewing a property.\n\n\nLead message: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.Message }}\n\n\nReturn only the category name. Do not include any other text, explanation, or punctuation.",
        "batching": {}
      },
